; The surgeon - a hulking thing that was once a surgeon, swollen with muscle through a gown soaked dark, his mask
; hanging from one ear, one great arm ending in bone claws like scalpels, a raw heart pulsing red through his chest.

[[Body
  [Biped [[Legs 0.62] [Torso 0.7] [Shoulders 0.36] [Hips 0.16] [Arms 0.74]]]]
 [Scale 1.6]
