                     [[To [Still Cut]] [Over 0.3]]
                     [[To Idle] [Over 0.55] [Marks [[End 1]]]]]]

   ; charge headlong, head down and arms out to seize whatever's in the way
   [Animation Tackle [[[From [Some [Still Coil]]] [To [Still Grab]] [Over 0.3] [Ease Out] [Layers [[[Lay [Overlay [[Cycle Stride] [Rate 2.4]]]] [Onward True]]]]]]]]]]
